### mount degraded (what the initrd policy will do when a full copy remains)
$ mount -o degraded,noatime,compress=zstd:1 /dev/mapper/onemind-data-vdb /data
$ onemind storage status
/data: DEGRADED (mounted degraded)
  ! 1 of 2 disks missing
  Data      raid1    400.0MiB used of 2.0GiB
  System    raid1    16.0KiB used of 64.0MiB
  Metadata  raid1    672.0KiB used of 512.0MiB
  devid 1  /dev/mapper/onemind-data-vdb 6.0GiB
  devid 2  MISSING                      0B
  repair: reconnect -> scrub -> soft-convert (onemind storage plan repair)

